<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Bank of Ireland's ICS 96 pretax 30 mln punt.</title>
<headline>Bank of Ireland's ICS 96 pretax 30 mln punt.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end December 31, 1996</p>
<p>					 (millions of punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax		29.6			   vs 26.7</p>
<p> New advances     127.6			   vs 91.5</p>
<p> Other income	 4.4			    vs 2.8</p>
<p>NOTE - ICS Building Society is part of Irish banking group Bank of Ireland Plc.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom</p>
